    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Berkeley & Associates are delighted to announce 23 Glenaulin Green to the market, a lovely three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached home with a converted attic, presented in excellent condition throughout.\r\nThe property enjoys a bright and well-proportioned layout, with the ground floor comprising a welcoming entrance hallway, a comfortable living room, a separate sitting room, and a spacious open-plan kitchen/dining area. The kitchen and dining space provides an ideal setting for modern family living, with access to the rear garden.\r\nUpstairs, the first floor offers three generously sized bedrooms and a family bathroom. The converted attic on the third floor provides an additional versatile space together with a bathroom, offering excellent potential for use as a guest bedroom, home office or additional living accommodation.\r\nTo the front, the property benefits from off-street parking, while the rear garden provides a private outdoor space ideal for relaxing and entertaining.\r\nSituated on a quiet, tree-lined road, 23 Glenaulin Green enjoys a peaceful setting while remaining within easy reach of a host of amenities and facilities. The property is well served by public transport and is conveniently located close to the M4 and M50, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and all major road networks.\r\nThis wonderful home offers generous and versatile accommodation together with an excellent location, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families and investors alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nWith tiled flooring and pendant lighting.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n 2.41 m x 4.53 m \r\nWith laminated wood flooring, pendant lighting, and a fireplace with tiled surroundings.\r\n\r\n Open plan Sitting Room/Dining/Kitchen\r\n 9.06 m x 4.77 m \r\nWith tiled flooring, a range of floor and eye level fitted presses, downlights & pendant lighting .\r\n\r\n Bedroom 1:\r\n2.44 m x 6.65 m \r\nWith laminate wood flooring, downlights, and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\n2.04 m x 2.97 m \r\nWith laminate wood flooring, pendant lighting, and built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n2.55 x 3.01\r\nWith laminate wood flooring , downlights and built in wardrobes .\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.78 x 1.79  \r\nWith laminate wood flooring, pendant lighting , WC,WHB, shower , cabinets below sink.\r\n\r\nAttic conversion \r\n4.57 x 5.28\r\nWith laminate wood flooring , pendant lighting , built in wardrobes .\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n2.01 x 2.37 \r\nWith tiled flooring , WC, WHB and shower ."
      },
